<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στακ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oozing out in drops, trickling, distilling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					529
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύρνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ulc.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Od.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Edict.Diocl.Delph.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυλοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					115a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἔλαιον</span> oil <i>that
				runs off without pressing, virgin</i>-oil, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				7.12.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἅλμη</span>
			<i>brine</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				20.46.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κονία</span>
			lime-<i>water</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.7.1
			</span></i> (but =
			<i>lye</i> from wood-ashes in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.569
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στακτά, τά</span>, perh. <i>filtering vessels</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.5.1
			</span></i>.</div>
